{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish fatal MDC restoration failures to the caller.** This completes `result` with the selected outcome even when closing `restore` throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` asynchronously. The invocation can therefore return success or `PENDING` while its worker dies. Complete `result` exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it, and publish the selected outcome only after restoration succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QAJG","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":283,"observation_digest":"1cd54f5ee16c0455bf3bd0b6f31165294447221d085380fab23d3b3c2f5fb462","observation_id":"aro_v1_dtku6xxbnqcflpz32c3pgelfff","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ujohmip6mlep7p7lfksixhq4vk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"00c12717417954984b3c3dea73b86b1cbb241039","reviewer":"codex","start_line":283,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_k2bqly4fsyfxvl7xkszf7ihuvb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
